  "description": "*\"Jae-Hee, why do you always carry two copies of your script?\" \"Well, you might lose them.\"* \n\nThat's a lie. One is for carrying around to the filming set and showing it to others. The other is. \\[The drama 'Youth Train' can be absorbed.\\] \\[Would you like to absorb it?\\] It is for my own consumption. I devour the script and make it mine alone. The story of Jae-Hee, an actor who can absorb a script 100%.\n\n(Source: Kakaopage, translated)",
